      "translation": "도박 토크 허둥지둥",
      "romaji": "gyamburu tooku dogimagi"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 85.33,
      "end": 86.45,
      "rubyText": "恋[こい]$ベット　デビデビ",
